    "body": "Thank you for writing this up with the code pointers.\n\nTriage: **P4** (work the maintainer asked for in his own words, quoted above), **effort:high**, **area:sim**, **area:ui**. A stock axis changes the stock geometry that simulation and collision checks use, so it gets the safety-level review. The axis change must go through the undoable stock command, with its MCP field, and the project file needs a version step.\n\nIf you take it on, please comment `claimed:` with your plan.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
