    "body": "Status: the quick gate was stopped for disk space (coordinator order). The claim stays.\n\n- The work is held on the pushed branch `issue/2576-stock-axis` at `d067defa4e5adb9daa8d0e8183617ca6d2fc2212`.\n- The quick gate (`cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`) is owed. The stopped run was still in its build steps. Its output was buffered, so no gate step result was read. No gate step failure was seen.\n- Before the gate, these were green on this head: `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test stock_axis` (4 tests), the `camcraft-ui` lib tests `stock_axis`, `layout_page_stock` and `stock_size` (8 tests), the `camcraft-geometry` lib tests `stock_axis` (2 tests), and `cargo clippy -p camcraft-geometry -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`.\n- The follow-up issue is #2758.\n- The worktree `target/` is cleaned. The gate runs again when a build slot is free.\n",
